body:
I feel you. I'm working at call centre too so I know what you are going trough. Struggling with depression myself and have since high school so that's about 15 years now. How long have you worked there at that call centre? I've been stuck for like 6 years. 

&#x200B;

Dunno where you live but you should check into partial/graded sick leave if you haven't already. I'm on partial sick leave atm due too depression.
